  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GAIN - Cabo Delgado Food Systems Strengthening Programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen and repair the local food system in the southern segment of Cabo Delgado province, which has been severely impacted by conflict, drought, and long-standing under-investment. It seeks to protect the consumption of the poorer residents of fourvulnerable districts, including internally displaced persons from conflict areas and their hosts, with actions to improve both the availability and the affordability of safe and nutritious foods in their communities.</narrative>
  </description>
